dictionaryVar["en-us"]["TAGLINE"] = "Multiplayer bird slinging action!";
dictionaryVar["en-us"]["SHORT_DESCRIPTION"] = "Angry Birds for Messenger is the first Angry Birds game where you challenge your friends to 1-on-1 battles!";
dictionaryVar["en-us"]["LONG_DESCRIPTION"] = "Angry Birds for Messenger is the first Angry Birds game where you challenge your friends to 1-on-1 battles! Try to pop their piggies before they pop yours, face-off in different arenas, and strategize using offensive and defensive power-ups! Use power-ups strategically to swing the match in your favor! You’re on the blue team and your opponent is on red. The first player to pop their opponent’s pigs wins the match! Classic Angry Birds gameplay with a new goal!";
dictionaryVar["en-us"]["ABOUT"] = "Challenge a friend to a game of Angry Birds anytime, anywhere on Facebook Instant games! Angry Birds for Messenger combines the satisfying slingshot gameplay and comic style that made Angry Birds a global phenomenon, with the ability to strike up a game instantly from Facebook Messenger. Engage in some friendly competition to see who has the best Angry Birds skills - or to decide where to get dinner. It's never been easier to play Angry Birds with a friend! **Angry Birds is optimized for iPhone 5, iPad 3, iPad mini 2 and iPod Touch 5G or newer devices. You can try it on older devices, but we can't guarantee a smooth bird flinging experience!";
